{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13111240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111240","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:6:1311124001:1":{"text":"各位，请留步。请问你们是什么人？为何要前来柳博米尔子爵的庄园？有和子爵先生预约吗？子爵先生不喜欢被打扰……","source_cn":"各位，请留步。请问你们是什么人？为何要前来柳博米尔子爵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD28E1ED2D83ED926","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311124002:1":{"text":"等等，你先等等！你是个会说话、会动的……烛台？！","source_cn":"等等，你先等等！你是个会说话、会动的……烛台？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A7867C826232CD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311124003:1":{"text":"瓦茨拉夫，为您效劳。我是柳博米尔子爵的管家，负责永寂庄园的一切日常事物。","source_cn":"瓦茨拉夫，为您效劳。我是柳博米尔子爵的管家，负责永寂庄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F492A549D073EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311124004:1":{"text":"哇，柳博米尔还是一位子爵？","source_cn":"哇，柳博米尔还是一位子爵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C498E45FB42F889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311124005:1":{"text":"当然！柳博米尔先生与历任白山大公同属瓦勒沙家族，一出生就被封为子爵，当时的白山大公是他的伯父。","source_cn":"当然！柳博米尔先生与历任白山大公同属瓦勒沙家族，一出生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F3D2E2339D50823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","do